From: Greg Diachenko <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:08:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional scroll film to product cinema pages

Product pages other than V-TECH were image-only. A per-slug film registry
(empty for now, so production is unchanged) lets a page scrub one muted
video behind its stages, with the images kept underneath as posters for
reduced motion and video errors. The seek loop is a generic copy of the
V-TECH one so VTechStory.tsx stays untouched.

Also fixes two small defects: headings lost the space before <br/> in
their text content, and the kit image declared 500x720 instead of its
real 800x1361.

